                      (       cocovtio.d):00026         *   as Keydrv has been merged back into VTIO to save some system RAM and CC3 Global Mem.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00027         *   Added labels for the buffered write routines for SCF and GRFDRV as well.
                      (       cocovtio.d):00028         *   (There appears to still be room for a CoVDG buffer as well, if we want to add one)
