0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00043         V.NGChr             RMB       1                   number of additional characters to get
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00044         V.RTAdd             RMB       2                   (2) return address after getting characters
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00045         V.NChar             RMB       1                   character to process
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00046         V.NChr2             RMB       1                   and the next one
                      (       cocovtio.d):00047                             RMB       1                   (I assume reserved for a 3rd parameter byte)
