0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00094         V.LKeyCd            RMB       1                   last key code
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00095         V.2Key1             RMB       1                   2nd Key 1
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00096         V.2Key2             RMB       1                   2nd Key 2
0004                  (       cocovtio.d):00097         V.2Key3             RMB       1                   2nd Key 3
